Package: FirnR
Title: Simulate Polar Snow and Firn Cores
Version: 0.1.0.9022
Authors@R: c(
    person("Thomas", "Laepple", email = "thomas.laepple@awi.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Thomas", "Münch", role = "aut"),
    person("Andrew M.", "Dolman", role = "ctb",
            comment = "Contributed to function is.equidistant."))
Description: FirnR provides tools for working with and simulating of polar firn
    and ice cores, with a focus on the isotopic composition. Methods implemented
    include the depth-dependent modelling of firn density and stable water
    isotopologue diffusion length; conversion of ice core depth scales;
    estimation of firn parameters and their changes over depth; simulation of
    temporal changes of firn isotope profiles from advection, depth scale
    compression and diffusion; and forward simulation of isotope profiles based
    on meteorological data.
